       [
        "DIFFERENT ANIMALS",
        "#ffffff",
        46,
        true
       ]
      ],
      "y": 120,
      "at": "40%"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "The harvestman, with the round little body, isn't even a spider.",
     "scene": "garden",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "xray",
     "say": "And it has no venom glands at all.",
     "scene": "microscope"
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "The crane fly, the giant mosquito look-alike? It's a fly. It can't bite you.",
     "scene": "garden",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "day"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "The cellar spider in your basement does have venom. Most spiders do.",
     "scene": "basement",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "Cellar spiders even catch and eat other spiders.",
     "scene": "basement",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "calm",
     "say": "But nobody has ever shown it's deadly to people. The story just keeps spreading.",
     "scene": "basement",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "Verdict: myth. The scariest thing about it is the rumor.",
     "scene": "basement",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     },
     "board": {
      "add": true,
