     "say": "Babies hatch with only a few pairs, and add more every time they molt.",
     "scene": "microscope"
    },
    {
     "m": "escalate",
     "say": "Grab one by the leg, and it just lets the leg go, and runs.",
     "scene": "bathroom",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "All those long legs let it run more than a foot every second.",
