    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "They love dark closets, and sweaters with stains or sweat on them.",
     "scene": "bedroom",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "night"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "Cotton and synthetics? Rarely touched, unless they're blended with wool.",
     "scene": "study",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "day"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "calm",
     "say": "The fix? Clean your wool before you store it, and keep it sealed.",
     "scene": "bedroom",
     "scene_p": {
      "time": "day"
     }
    },
    {
     "m": "fact",
     "say": "Verdict: myth. Well, half. The moth is innocent. Its kids are not.",
